

Prograam faaral-njaboot.


>> Veggy := Denc xees.
Veggy bu: ['xees'] def: {
	>> v := man xees.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy bu: ['init'] def: { sama veggies := 0. }.

Veggy bu: ['carrots:'] def: { :a sama veggies := a. <- Dara. }.
Veggy bu: ['carrots'] def: { <- sama veggies. }.
Veggy bu: ['+'] def: { :f
	>> n := Veggy xees.
	n carrots: (f carrots + sama veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy bu: ['mbind'] def: { <- sama veggies mbind.
}.

Lim bu: ['carrots'] def: {
	>> x := Veggy xees.
	x carrots: man. <- x.
}.

Lim bu: ['add:and:'] def: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Génn bind: q, taxaw.
